                <mxCell id="16" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontStyle=1" value="✋ DONE — the run ends BY ITSELF&#xa;the count simply ran out — no stop, no crash" vertex="1">
