                <mxCell id="17" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=2;fontColor=#9673a6;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="Quest is the ONLY tool that ends on its own. The launcher tells this self-end from a stop by comparing the run&#39;s own token (§1.3) — the card reads &quot;stopped&quot; for both." vertex="1">
